        <definition>void vart::NpuTensor::sync_buffer</definition>
        <argsstring>() const</argsstring>
        <name>sync_buffer</name>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Synchronizes the tensor buffer between CPU and AIE. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Ensures data consistency between CPU and AIE by performing cache operations based on the tensor&apos;s direction:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>For <ref refid="namespacevart_1a9a98f13e9246c207893fd0923dfd6f17aa84cc046d48610b05c21fd3670d0c829" kindref="member">TensorDirection::INPUT</ref>, flushes cache to DDR for reading by AIE.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>For <ref refid="namespacevart_1a9a98f13e9246c207893fd0923dfd6f17a50a87f0d71f7221582dad4bf507a0f34" kindref="member">TensorDirection::OUTPUT</ref>, invalidates cache for reading by CPU.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>void</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Supported only for NpuTensors allocated using <ref refid="classvart_1_1Runner_1a86b257cd70b838396aff577724afcc7a" kindref="member">vart::Runner::allocate_npu_tensor</ref>. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
